ThermaCache AI — 4 Key Test Metrics Simplified
1-Page Summary: What our test results show vs. what we are building next
Overview: Our early test results (Proof-of-Concept) prove that saving prompt memory and routing traffic away from hot GPUs works.
Here is a simple explanation of our 4 main metrics and our production goals.
